  credits: "# TWINKLE OPS \u2014 Asset credits and modifications\r\n\r\nAll listed resources are stored locally. This game contains no resources extracted from other commercial games.\r\n\r\n* M4A1 \u2014 3DModelsCC0, submitted by nisu. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/m4a1-assault-rifle . URP material conversion and original charging-handle animation.\r\n* AKM \u2014 LonesomeDucky. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/akm . Blender-to-FBX conversion and URP materials.\r\n* Unfinished Buildings \u2014 loafbrr_1. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/unfinished-buildings . Selected structures arranged into a quarantine construction district; collision-only meshes hidden.\r\n* Infected worker model \u2014 Pixelhouse. CC BY 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/ . https://opengameart.org/content/zombie . Author website: http://www.pixelhouse.com.ar . Changes: scale, URP materials, humanoid retargeting.\r\n* Infected animations \u2014 Rikindle3D. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/male-city-zombie-ready-for-use-in-game-engines . Humanoid retargeting and animation state machine. The original burned character mesh is not used in the raid.\r\n* First-person arms \u2014 para / MakeHuman team. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/fps-arms-rigged-only . URP materials and original procedural poses.\r\n* Concrete Road Barrier \u2014 Amal Kumar; Barrel 03 \u2014 Serhii Khromov; Old Military Crate \u2014 Jack Mava; Asphalt 02 \u2014 Rob Tuytel. Poly Haven, CC0. https://polyhaven.com/license . Individual sources: https://polyhaven.com/a/concrete_road_barrier , https://polyhaven.com/a/barrel_03 , https://polyhaven.com/a/old_military_crate , https://polyhaven.com/a/asphalt_02 . Changes: 2K texture selection, URP conversion, crate variant selection.\r\n* Recorded AR-15 and AK-47 shots \u2014 Ben Jaszczak, Brian Nelson, Kevin Heras, Matthew Nanney. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/the-free-firearm-sound-library . AR-15 trimmed single shot; AK-47 changed in V1.1 to the isolated final discharge of C_27P, eliminating the mistakenly included long burst. Mono 48kHz, normalized. AR-15 recording accompanies the M4A1 model.\r\n* Rifle reload \u2014 SpringySpringo. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/gun-reload-sounds . Recorded using airsoft equipment.\r\n* Wind loop \u2014 SketchMan3, derived from JaggedStone's Loopable Dungeon Ambience. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/wind-whoosh-loop and https://opengameart.org/content/loopable-dungeon-ambience .\r\n* Noto Sans SC \u2014 Google / Noto contributors. SIL Open Font License 1.1; accompanying OFL.txt. The UI subset is modified and renamed Twinkle Ops SC; unused glyphs removed for Web delivery.\r\n* Item UI illustrations \u2014 original project artwork created for TWINKLE OPS.\r\n\r\nDownload source pages, SHA-256 hashes and original archives are retained under SourceAssets/OpenGameArt and SourceAssets/PolyHaven on the local drive. Only redistributable converted assets are intended for Git LFS.\r\n\r\n## V1.1 additions\r\n\r\n* M9 Knife PBR \u2014 khairul169, CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/m9-knife-pbr . Original model and PBR maps, resized and converted to URP; original procedural first-person swing.\r\n* Remington 870 model \u2014 MikeMoon, CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/shotgun-1 . Model converted to FBX, UVs repacked, original project wood/steel texture variations baked at 1K. The model is a lightweight asset; it does not include a professionally captured reload animation.\r\n* Shotgun recording \u2014 Free Firearm Sound Library authors credited above, CC0. Model 12/K_22P.wav, isolated 1.1-second discharge, normalized mono. This is a Winchester Model 12 recording used with the M870 model, not a claim that it was recorded from an M870.\r\n* Melee swish \u2014 remaxim, based on qubodup's bamboo-stick swishes, CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/3-melee-sounds . Volume balanced for the knife.\r\n* Metal Trash Can \u2014 GurJas Studios; Metal Toolbox \u2014 Mateusz Sadek; Vintage Suitcase \u2014 Maximilian Schuster; Trashbag \u2014 Benny Weimer; Old Bed Frame \u2014 Luca B; Shelf 01 \u2014 Gabriel Radi\u0107; Tool Cart \u2014 Savva Zakharov. Poly Haven, CC0, https://polyhaven.com/license . Individual assets: https://polyhaven.com/a/metal_trash_can , https://polyhaven.com/a/metal_toolbox , https://polyhaven.com/a/vintage_suitcase , https://polyhaven.com/a/trashbag , https://polyhaven.com/a/old_bed_frame , https://polyhaven.com/a/Shelf_01 , https://polyhaven.com/a/tool_cart . 1K PBR textures, URP conversion, bounds/collision setup. Source API metadata and checksums in Assets/ThirdParty/V11/SOURCES.json.\r\n* Metal safe with combination lock \u2014 johndh. Chosen license: **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported**, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/ . Source: https://opengameart.org/content/metal-safe-with-combination-lock . Changes: mesh conversion, UV atlas and weathered steel texture bake. The safe model, its adapted mesh and safe-specific textures remain under CC BY-SA 3.0; this does not relicense unrelated game code/assets. Original source is provided in Docs/AssetSources/Safe.blend, alongside the reproducible conversion script in Tools/BakeV11Assets.py. Do not remove this attribution or apply additional restrictions to these safe assets.\r\n\r\nV1.1 infected variants derive from the credited Pixelhouse worker: weighted head-mesh proportions, stature and material tints. They retain CC BY 3.0 attribution. These are variants of one base character, not independently authored character models.\r\n\r\n\r\n## V1.2 additions\r\n\r\n* Modular Factory Facade \u2014 James Ray Cock; Plastered Wall 02 \u2014 Charlotte Baglioni; Concrete Floor \u2014 eye-candy.xyz. Poly Haven, CC0, https://polyhaven.com/license . Sources: https://polyhaven.com/a/modular_factory_facade , https://polyhaven.com/a/plastered_wall_02 , https://polyhaven.com/a/concrete_floor . Selected facade modules exported with original UVs, 1K PBR maps converted to URP. Original connected floor plan, stairs, bridge and structural surfaces authored for TWINKLE OPS. Source metadata and SHA-256 records: Assets/ThirdParty/V12/SOURCES.json. Powered by Poly Haven.\r\n* Search reveal tones, impact texture masks and connecting stair/bridge meshes are original project work. No Delta Force assets, map layout or UI artwork are included.\r\n\r\n* Kloofendal 48d Partly Cloudy (Pure Sky) \u2014 Greg Zaal (original), Jarod Guest (sky edits). CC0, https://polyhaven.com/a/kloofendal_48d_partly_cloudy_puresky . 2K HDR panorama, exposure and rotation adjusted for the original level.\r\n"
